<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.1">
<l>neykkuṭat taippaṟṟi yēṟu meṟumpukaḷ pōlniran teṅkuṅ</l>
<l>kaikkoṇṭu niṟkiṉṟa nōykāḷ kālam peṟavuyyap pōmiṉ</l>
<l>meykkoṇṭu vantu pukuntu vētap pirāṉār kiṭantār</l>
<l>paikkoṇṭa pāmpaṇai yōṭum paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>O diseases which take hold, spreading everywhere like</l>
<l rend="indent">ants that swarm a butter pot!</l>
<l>Go! Escape as soon as you can!</l>
<l>The Lord of the Vedas who came and took</l>
<l rend="indent">[my] body, entering [my heart]!</l>
<l>Unlike before, [this] maritime town is protected by</l>
<l rend="indent">the one who reclines on a hooded serpent bed.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
